OL,3,AFormer DUP leader Jeffrey Donaldson
OL,4,Asentenced to 15 years in prison for
OL,5,Achild sex abuse
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe former leader of the Democratic
OL,8,FUnionist Party, Jeffrey Donaldson, has
OL,9,Fbeen sentenced to 15 years in prison
OL,10,Ffor a series of child sex offences,
OL,11,Fincluding rape
OL,13,FDonaldson was convicted in June of 18
OL,14,Fcounts of sex abuse, which he committed
OL,15,Fagainst two women when they were
OL,16,Fchildren. The offences occurred between
OL,17,F1985 and 2008
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
