OL,3,AFormer DUP leader Jeffrey Donaldson
OL,4,Asentenced to 15 years in prison for
OL,5,Achild sex abuse
OL,6,
OL,7,FReading statements from the victims
OL,8,Fbefore passing sentence, the judge says
OL,9,Fone woman grew up feeling ashamed,
OL,10,Fwhile the other says: "Every day I pray
OL,11,FGod will let me die"
OL,13,FThe judge says the ex-MP's offences
OL,14,Fhave led to a "catastrophic descent
OL,15,Finto disgrace". He was stripped of his
OL,16,Fknighthood in July
OL,18,FThe DUP - which Donaldson led from 2021
OL,19,Fto 2024 - says: "He deserves every day
OL,20,Fof the lengthy prison sentence"
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
