OL,3,AMore than 30 children killed in
OL,4,APakistan school roof collapse as owner
OL,5,Aarrested
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 34 people have been killed
OL,8,Fafter a school roof collapsed in
OL,9,FPakistan, with hospitals saying the
OL,10,Flarge majority are children under the
OL,11,Fage of 13
OL,13,FMohammad Asim, spokesperson for
OL,14,FPeshawar's Lady Reading Hospital, says
OL,15,Fat least 19 others are injured - some
OL,16,Fcritically
OL,18,FThe owner of the school has been
OL,19,Farrested, police say, as investigations
OL,20,Fare carried out into the structure of
OL,21,Fthe building
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
