OL,5,Aarrested
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a statement, the office of
OL,8,FPakistan's President Asif Ali Zardari
OL,9,Fsays "this heart-wrenching tragedy has
OL,10,Fplunged the entire nation into shock"
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
