OL,3,ATwo dead in Istanbul after heaviest
OL,4,Arainfall in 84 years, governor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have died after severe
OL,7,Fflooding caused by what the governor of
OL,8,FIstanbul said was the heaviest rainfall
OL,9,Fin 84 years, BBC Turkish has reported.
OL,11,FA14-year-old boy died after he was
OL,12,Felectrocuted when he stepped in a
OL,13,Fpuddle, while a 34-year-old man
OL,14,Fattempting to cross the road slipped
OL,15,Fand fell, hitting his head on the
OL,16,Fpavement.
OL,18,FNearly 600 people have been rescued
OL,19,Fafter becoming stranded, the city's
OL,20,Fdeputy mayor said, with cars submerged
OL,21,Fin water in some districts.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
